OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFor southern areas, there will
OL,6,Fbe some fog during the morning, and
OL,7,Ffeeling cold too with some frost
OL,8,Fpatches. Dry but mostly cloudy during
OL,9,Fthe day, especially further north,
OL,10,Fwith the longest sunny spells in the
OL,11,Fsouth. A cool day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry with clear spells in the
OL,14,Fsouth, but cloudier further north.
OL,15,FUnder calm, clear skies, areas of mist
OL,16,Fand fog will develop. A cold night
OL,17,Fwith a touch of frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,169,160,301,260,100,100
