OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FFog will lift through the
OL,6,Fmorning to bring long spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine, in the south. Cloudier
OL,8,Ffurther north, though it will become
OL,9,Fgradually clearer. Feeling cool, calm
OL,10,Fand dry.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FFog
OL,13,Fand frost on Monday morning, then
OL,14,Fsunny. A cold start again on Tuesday,
OL,15,Fand cloud will gradually thicken ahead
OL,16,Fof evening rain. Milder, wetter and
OL,17,Fbreezier on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
